    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.poster.avif?t=1754586207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.webm?t=1754586207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.mp4?t=1754586207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a futuristic Japan overrun by spirits, <strong>Spaceman Memories</strong> is a true ode to classic JRPGs of the past. The game's world coupled with its heartwarming narrative, offer players a chance to relive the good old days of 2D gaming. As the spaceman Ichiro 94, whose capsule mysteriously landed back home after a space mission, players embark on a poignant journey of self-discovery, encountering strange creatures, and battling formidable foes, all while uncovering the secrets of his forgotten past and ancient Japanese mysticism. With each step, players must also solve puzzles and use Ichiro's abilities to fight, all of which are vital in the quest to uncover the truth about his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/ba5a6e15ee555093c65e79fe019ffbe0.poster.avif?t=1754586207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/ba5a6e15ee555093c65e79fe019ffbe0.webm?t=1754586207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/ba5a6e15ee555093c65e79fe019ffbe0.mp4?t=1754586207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautifully crafted retro Japanese game, brought to life in a vibrant 3D world brimming with emotion and nostalgia. This heartwarming adventure, seamlessly blends open-world exploration with puzzles and turn based battles offering a truly unforgettable experience!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic, story-driven exploration and masterfully crafted turn-based battles in a classic JRPG experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a captivating journey through a world inspired by ancient Japanese folklore, brought to life in hand-crafted 3D pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and emotional storyline that explores themes of memory, identity, and the painful realities of loss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of quests and challenging boss battles offering an engaging nostalgic experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through diverse environments ranging from futuristic cities to long-forgotten dungeons to magical forests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack made with nostalgic synths that perfectly capture the game's retro atmosphere</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.poster.avif?t=1754586207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.webm?t=1754586207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/43aeb823a1b87748d93efac3b2765f99.mp4?t=1754586207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a futuristic Japan overrun by spirits, <strong>Spaceman Memories</strong> is a true ode to classic JRPGs of the past. The game's world coupled with its heartwarming narrative, offer players a chance to relive the good old days of 2D gaming. As the spaceman Ichiro 94, whose capsule mysteriously landed back home after a space mission, players embark on a poignant journey of self-discovery, encountering strange creatures, and battling formidable foes, all while uncovering the secrets of his forgotten past and ancient Japanese mysticism. With each step, players must also solve puzzles and use Ichiro's abilities to fight, all of which are vital in the quest to uncover the truth about his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/ba5a6e15ee555093c65e79fe019ffbe0.poster.avif?t=1754586207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/ba5a6e15ee555093c65e79fe019ffbe0.webm?t=1754586207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354580/extras/ba5a6e15ee555093c65e79fe019ffbe0.mp4?t=1754586207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautifully crafted retro Japanese game, brought to life in a vibrant 3D world brimming with emotion and nostalgia. This heartwarming adventure, seamlessly blends open-world exploration with puzzles and turn based battles offering a truly unforgettable experience!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic, story-driven exploration and masterfully crafted turn-based battles in a classic JRPG experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a captivating journey through a world inspired by ancient Japanese folklore, brought to life in hand-crafted 3D pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and emotional storyline that explores themes of memory, identity, and the painful realities of loss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of quests and challenging boss battles offering an engaging nostalgic experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through diverse environments ranging from futuristic cities to long-forgotten dungeons to magical forests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack made with nostalgic synths that perfectly capture the game's retro atmosphere</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Spaceman Memories is a retro JRPG that takes place in a distant future but draws inspiration from ancient Japanese folktales. A story full of wonder and nostalgia as you take on the role of Ichiro 94, an astronaut who wakes up from hypersleep to go on a journey to find the remnants of his past.",
